{"id":6222,"date":"2021-02-24T20:01:03","date_gmt":"2021-02-24T17:01:03","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/gruv-apps.com\/?p=6222"},"modified":"2021-02-26T13:35:46","modified_gmt":"2021-02-26T10:35:46","slug":"big-hexagon-puzzle","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/en.gruv-apps.com\/big-hexagon-puzzle\/","title":{"rendered":"Big Hexagon Puzzle"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Big Hexagon Puzzle is a classic bubbles game, where you must select a color group of hexagons on a grid and click to destroy them.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Combine a group of two or more adjacent cells with the numbers (5, 50, 500, &#8230;) in a single cell with a larger value (10, 100, 1000, &#8230;):<br>5&nbsp; + 5&nbsp; = 10<br>50 + 50 = 100<br>500+ 500= 1000<br>&#8230;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Combine a group of 5 or more adjacent cells with the numbers (1, 10, 100,&#8230;) in a single cell with a larger value&nbsp; (5, 50, 500, &#8230;):<br>1&nbsp;&nbsp; +&nbsp; 1&nbsp;&nbsp; + 1&nbsp;&nbsp; + 1&nbsp;&nbsp; + 1&nbsp; = 5&nbsp;<br>10&nbsp; + 10&nbsp; + 10&nbsp; + 10&nbsp; + 10&nbsp; = 50<br>100 + 100 + 100 + 100 + 100 = 500<br>&#8230;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>When the hexagons are deleted from the field new hexagons appear.<br>6-color hexagon (jocker) substitutes for all other.<br>Earn points as much as possible!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Game Features:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>3 game modes:<br>1) Timed &#8212; with a limited time<br>2) Moves &#8212; with a limited number of moves<br>3) Infinite &#8212; without any restrictions<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can choose the size of the field:<br>7&#215;7, 9&#215;9, 11&#215;11<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The number of different hexagons:<br>6, 8, 10, 11, 12<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are modes with jocker and without it.<br>The game has an undo move button.<br>There is&nbsp; saving the game when you exit it.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Big Hexagon Puzzle is a classic bubbles game, where you must select a color group of hexagons on a grid and click to destroy them. Combine a group of two or m